00:23:16.941 --> 00:23:17.440
So yep.

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:20.200
Very excited about seeing
more of these things

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:21.130
related to the Cloud.

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:21.590
MARK MANDEL: Definitely.

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:22.380
Definitely.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:25.400
So moving onto our
question of the week,

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:27.150
this is an
interesting one, too--

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:31.160
