00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:34.210
It's a question around is
there any Google Cloud Platform

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:36.660
certification or
training, like if you

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:39.775
need to be able to say yes,
I definitely know this thing,

00:23:39.775 --> 00:23:41.400
how do you get that
piece of paper that

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:43.280
says that you definitely do?

00:23:43.280 --> 00:23:45.980
FRANCESC CAMPOY: So the
answer is, of course, yes.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.500
There's actually a web
page with all the trainings

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:50.160
that we support.

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:54.225
And that link is actually
cloud.google.com/training,

00:23:54.225 --> 00:23:57.220
quite obviously.

00:23:57.220 --> 00:24:00.300
And you will find there a
bunch of different classes.

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:04.050
Some of the classes, like
CP100, CP200, CP300--

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:07.100
those are the main
classes where you're

00:24:07.100 --> 00:24:12.040
going to learn about
general topics of the Cloud,

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:16.550
starting from what is the Cloud
and why how they store my data,

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:19.870
how they connect between
different instances, that kind

00:24:19.870 --> 00:24:23.000
of stuff, to things that
are way more evolved.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:25.880
Like you will be able to
see something very specific

00:24:25.880 --> 00:24:30.760
about well, how do I package
my containers-- my Docker

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:32.880
containers-- to be
deployed onto a container

00:24:32.880 --> 00:24:34.720
engine and stuff like that.

00:24:34.720 --> 00:24:37.740
So you will find a bunch
of different trainings

00:24:37.740 --> 00:24:40.365
and, also, certifications.

00:24:40.365 --> 00:24:42.240
MARK MANDEL: I'm actually
