00:24:53.842 --> 00:24:55.300
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Yeah, there's SQL.

00:24:55.300 --> 00:24:55.780
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:24:55.780 --> 00:24:57.863
FRANCESC CAMPOY: You can
find basically everything

00:24:57.863 --> 00:24:59.380
you might be interested in.

00:24:59.380 --> 00:25:01.070
MARK MANDEL: This is actually
