00:25:01.070 --> 00:25:02.710
OK, and a variety
of locations, too.

00:25:02.710 --> 00:25:03.600
Some are online.

00:25:03.600 --> 00:25:06.010
Some are actually physically
in particular places.

00:25:06.010 --> 00:25:07.093
That's actually very cool.

00:25:07.093 --> 00:25:08.142
I did not know that.

00:25:08.142 --> 00:25:09.350
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah, it is.

00:25:09.350 --> 00:25:12.500
It's a very interesting resource
because you will have access

00:25:12.500 --> 00:25:14.280
to a lot of different material.

00:25:14.280 --> 00:25:16.660
And then in the end,
you're pretty much

00:25:16.660 --> 00:25:20.420
