through those certifications.

00:25:20.420 --> 00:25:23.630
And once you get them, they're
kind of showing that, yeah.

00:25:23.630 --> 00:25:25.010
You know what you're doing.

00:25:25.010 --> 00:25:26.070
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:25:26.070 --> 00:25:27.260
That's really interesting.

00:25:27.260 --> 00:25:28.510
