certification, right now,

00:25:54.150 --> 00:25:59.520
it doesn't expire, basically
because it's quite new.

00:25:59.520 --> 00:26:02.140
But it's these kind of
things that, basically, you

00:26:02.140 --> 00:26:05.370
want to do regularly, because
our products keep evolving.

00:26:05.370 --> 00:26:07.885
So saying that you are
an expert on a technology

00:26:07.885 --> 00:26:11.090
but you got that
certifications two years ago,

00:26:11.090 --> 00:26:13.830
well, I mean it's
still valid, of course.

00:26:13.830 --> 00:26:17.500
But it's always good to try to
refresh those certifications

00:26:17.500 --> 00:26:20.060
if that's something that can
help your career, really.

00:26:20.060 --> 00:26:20.400
